    "title": "US Police Car Helicopter Chase",
    "description": "Welcome to the US Police Flying Helicopter Car Gangster Crime Chase Game. Police Heli Car Game is designed for police flying car game lovers who want to play police helicopter shooting games, flying car shooting games, and chase the city gangster. You will fly a helicopter car to chase and shoot the Vegas City gangsters and enemy robots in a police heli car simulator game. You will also drive super police cars to chase and find the most wanted grand gangster mafia in the gangster city in police heli car chase simulator games. Drive the police flying car will test your car chase and car shooting skills in police heli car driving games. Here you will try flying police helicopter car to chase the most dangerous city gangster mafia and clean the crime city from Vegas city gangsters in a police flying car transport simulator Game. In police heli car games and crime shooting games, show your skills as a pro-flying car driver in police car helicopter chase games. play the police flying car game, crime chase games, and defeat the grand city gangsters and alien robots in flying car police helicopter driving simulator car games.\r\n\r\nFlying Police heli car gangster crime city game is waiting for you to explore it. Take your police heli car to the sky, fly around the city, and be the best police heli car driver in this realistic police helicopter flying car simulator game ever. As a professional police helicopter flying car game pilot fly in the air to complete unique missions of chasing the city gangsters and transporting criminals in different weather and security situations in police heli car transport simulator games. You can detect your missions starting checkpoints or fly around the open world in city police heli car chase simulator car games. Grab the police flying car game control stick to transport criminals & high prisoners to police stations within time and improve yourself as a professional police flying car driver in heli car gangster crime chase game. The police heli car simulator is equipped with some real firepower like missiles, mag-rifle charged rounds, heavy repeater laser turrets, ion cannons, laser rifles and so much more!\r\n\r\nPlay police heli car crime shooting games to recuse crime city from gangster mafia in police flying car simulator gangster crime chase games. All police games are for lover who wants to kill criminals of Vice City in flying car driving games. Police heli car crime shooting games are full of action as police cops perform rescue missions in all police flying car games. Be a great police heli car driver of a police helicopter in police flying car chase games and police car shooting games. You are the only hope in this police car crime shooting game to save humanity from being killed by the gangster mafia of all police heli car games. Get into the action of police cop duty in flying car driving games at any time with alerts from the police radio, and witness the real cop action in police heli car chase simulator games. In Police Heli Car Game, explore the gangster city in your flying cop car in all police helicopter car chase games. Let's Download the police heli car driving games do whatever it takes to be one of the great police officers in all police flying car crime shooting games.\r\n\r\nFeatures of police helicopter flying car gangster crime chase car games are:\r\n- Top-quality graphics of police heli car chase games.\r\n- High-quality police shooting sounds & effects from extreme police heli-car chase games\r\n- Realistic Vegas city environment-based levels from police heli car transport simulator games.\r\n- High-quality criminal chase animations from police flying car driving simulator games.\r\n- Smooth controls for movements around the survival city in police heli car games.\r\n- Highly addictive gangster chasing games based play mode of police flying car games",
